<title>HONG KONG: Shanghai Ind acquisition talks progress.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Ind acquisition talks progress.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai Industrial Holdings Ltd said in a statement on Monday that it had made progress in talks relating to certain acquisitions and an announcement would be made on the signing of agreements.</p>
<p>The statement was issued at the request of the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong. Shanghai Industrial shares were up HK$0.75 at HK$21.85 in late-morning trade.</p>
<p>The company said last month that it expected to complete plans for an asset injection by year-end and that it was considering several possible financing plans.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
</text>
